{"seq":1,"slug":"refurb-resell-recycle-route","title":"翻新转售与回收处置衔接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-in-exchange-program/circular-downstream-policy/refurb-resell-recycle-route","wordCount":2699,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"翻新转售与回收处置衔接\">翻新转售与回收处置衔接</h1><p>验机台上那台机器的状态向量已经确定，接下来要决定它的去向。这个决定表面上是一个经济计算——按哪条路走能回收最多价值——实际上它是一次<strong>多方约束的求交</strong>：设备客观状态决定技术上可行的路线，目的地法域的法规决定法律上允许的路线，市场需求与产能决定经济上划算的路线。三条约束的交集为空时，设备只能按废物处置，而这个结果应当在报价阶段就被预见到，否则平台会用高价收进一批无法变现的设备。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三条处置路线及其门槛\">核心概念：三条处置路线及其门槛</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  S[验机通过的状态向量] --&gt; R{路线判定}&#10;  R --&gt;|状态达标 + 有翻新产能| A[翻新 -&gt; 转售]&#10;  R --&gt;|可修复缺陷| B[换件修复 -&gt; 再判定]&#10;  R --&gt;|不可翻新 + 有资质| C[拆解回收 -&gt; 材料再生]&#10;  R --&gt;|法规禁止或危险| D[合规处置 / 原物退回]&#10;  A --&gt; A1[二手上架 -&gt; 质检分级披露]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[持证处置方 -&gt; 材料回收率证据]&#10;  B --&gt; R\">graph TD\n  S[验机通过的状态向量] --&gt; R{路线判定}\n  R --&gt;|状态达标 + 有翻新产能| A[翻新 -&gt; 转售]\n  R --&gt;|可修复缺陷| B[换件修复 -&gt; 再判定]\n  R --&gt;|不可翻新 + 有资质| C[拆解回收 -&gt; 材料再生]\n  R --&gt;|法规禁止或危险| D[合规处置 / 原物退回]\n  A --&gt; A1[二手上架 -&gt; 质检分级披露]\n  C --&gt; C1[持证处置方 -&gt; 材料回收率证据]\n  B --&gt; R</pre><p><strong>翻新转售</strong>是价值回收率最高的路线。它的门槛由两部分组成：设备状态达到翻新标准（功能完好、无结构性损伤、激活锁已解除），以及平台在该市场有翻新产能或合作的持证翻新方。翻新后的商品以二手形式上架，其定价与披露义务受当地消费者法约束——「翻新」与「全新」的区分、成色分级披露、以及质保责任的承继，都是必须显式处理的合规项。</p>\n<p><strong>拆解回收</strong>是价值回收率较低但适用范围最广的路线。它的门槛主要是资质：处理电子废物需要持证处置方，且处置过程要能提供材料回收的证据。这条路线在近年因法规趋严而变得更重——生产者的回收义务与申报要求把「随便找一家回收商」变成了一个合规风险点。</p>\n<p><strong>合规处置或原物退回</strong>是兜底路线。它适用于法规禁止该状态设备进入市场的法域、或设备本身属于危险类别（膨胀电池、被污染的设备）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>路线</th>\n<th>价值回收率</th>\n<th>主要门槛</th>\n<th>合规负担</th>\n<th>典型占比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>翻新转售</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>状态 + 产能 + 市场准入</td>\n<td>二手披露与质保</td>\n<td>与品类强相关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>换件修复</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>配件供应 + 工时</td>\n<td>维修记录</td>\n<td>视缺陷分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拆解回收</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>持证处置方</td>\n<td>回收率证据与申报</td>\n<td>兜底</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合规处置</td>\n<td>负（成本）</td>\n<td>危险品处置资质</td>\n<td>危废申报</td>\n<td>少量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"平台翻新的状态门槛\">平台翻新的状态门槛</h2><p>翻新门槛不能只由「能不能开机」决定，它需要一份可判定的状态规格。Apple 的官方翻新业务给出了一个可参考的形态：每台设备经过完整功能测试、彻底清洁与检查、按需更换原厂配件，iOS 设备更换新电池与外壳，并附带标准一年有限保修（<a href=\"https://www.apple.com/shop/refurbished/about\">Apple Certified Refurbished</a>）。这个描述的工程含义是：翻新的门槛不只是「能用」，还包括<strong>可更换件的状态</strong>与<strong>可承诺的质保</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"REFURB_SPEC = {&#10;    &quot;activation_lock&quot;: &quot;off&quot;,              # 硬性&#10;    &quot;function_test&quot;: &quot;pass_all&quot;,           # 硬性&#10;    &quot;structural_damage&quot;: False,            # 硬性（变形/进水）&#10;    &quot;replaceable_parts_policy&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;battery_health_pct_below&quot;: 85,    # 低于则换电池&#10;        &quot;screen&quot;: [&quot;scratch&quot;, &quot;cracked&quot;],  # 有则换屏&#10;        &quot;outer_shell&quot;: [&quot;worn&quot;, &quot;deformed&quot;] # 有则换壳&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;min_grade_for_resale&quot;: &quot;B&quot;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;def refurb_route(measured, parts_available):&#10;    if measured[&quot;activation_lock&quot;] != &quot;off&quot;:&#10;        return {&quot;route&quot;: &quot;return_to_owner&quot;, &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;activation_lock_on&quot;}&#10;    if measured[&quot;structural_damage&quot;]:&#10;        return {&quot;route&quot;: &quot;recycle&quot;, &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;structural_damage&quot;}&#10;    if measured[&quot;function_test&quot;] != &quot;pass_all&quot;:&#10;        return {&quot;route&quot;: &quot;recycle&quot;, &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;function_fail&quot;}&#10;    swaps = []&#10;    if measured[&quot;battery_health_pct&quot;] &lt; REFURB_SPEC[&quot;replaceable_parts_policy&quot;][&quot;battery_health_pct_below&quot;]:&#10;        swaps.append(&quot;battery&quot;)&#10;    if measured[&quot;screen&quot;] in REFURB_SPEC[&quot;replaceable_parts_policy&quot;][&quot;screen&quot;]:&#10;        swaps.append(&quot;screen&quot;)&#10;    if any(s not in parts_available for s in swaps):&#10;        return {&quot;route&quot;: &quot;recycle&quot;, &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;parts_unavailable&quot;, &quot;needed&quot;: swaps}&#10;    return {&quot;route&quot;: &quot;refurb_resell&quot;, &quot;swaps&quot;: swaps}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">REFURB_SPEC</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"activation_lock\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"off\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 硬性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"function_test\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pass_all\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 硬性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"structural_damage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 硬性（变形/进水）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"replaceable_parts_policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"battery_health_pct_below\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">85</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 低于则换电池</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"screen\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"scratch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cracked\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 有则换屏</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"outer_shell\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"worn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"deformed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 有则换壳</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"min_grade_for_resale\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> refurb_route</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(measured, parts_available):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> measured[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"activation_lock\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"off\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"route\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"return_to_owner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"activation_lock_on\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> measured[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"structural_damage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"route\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"recycle\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"structural_damage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> measured[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"function_test\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"pass_all\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"route\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"recycle\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"function_fail\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    swaps </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> measured[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"battery_health_pct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> REFURB_SPEC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"replaceable_parts_policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"battery_health_pct_below\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        swaps.append(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"battery\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> measured[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"screen\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> REFURB_SPEC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"replaceable_parts_policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"screen\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        swaps.append(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"screen\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">not</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parts_available </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> swaps):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"route\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"recycle\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"parts_unavailable\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"needed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: swaps}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"route\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"refurb_resell\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"swaps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: swaps}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两个判定细节值得说明。<strong>换件可行性是翻新的隐性门槛</strong>：一台状态很好但缺某个配件的老机型，可能因为配件断供而只能回收。把 <code>parts_available</code> 作为输入显式传入，比在翻新厂里临时发现缺件更早暴露问题。<strong>激活锁是硬性否决项</strong>：带锁设备既不能翻新也不能作为二手出售，只能退回原主，这是防盗设计的一部分，不是可协商的政策。</p>\n<h3 id=\"翻新成本的计入与定价\">翻新成本的计入与定价</h3><p>翻新路线是否划算，取决于「翻新后售价 - 翻新成本 - 处置成本」是否高于「直接回收的材料价值」。这个比较必须在<strong>报价阶段</strong>用期望值做一次，否则平台会在收进一批设备后才发现某些型号整体亏损。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>refurb</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>resale</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>退货率</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>parts</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>labor</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>logistics</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>warranty</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{refurb}} = P_{\\text{resale}} \\times (1 - \\text{退货率}) - C_{\\text{parts}} - C_{\\text{labor}} - C_{\\text{logistics}} - C_{\\text{warranty}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">refurb</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">resale</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">退货率</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">parts</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">labor</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">logistics</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">warranty</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>warranty</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{warranty}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">warranty</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是最容易漏掉的一项：翻新商品需要承担质保责任，其期望成本与设备年龄和翻新深度正相关。忽略它会让翻新看起来总是划算，直到质保成本在若干个月后集中显现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"二阶市场准入与合规\">二阶市场准入与合规</h2><p>翻新后的设备要作为二手商品在某个市场销售，受该市场对二手商品的准入规则约束。近年的两个法规方向显著改变了这门生意的成本结构。</p>\n<p><strong>第一是右修权与消费者保护方向。</strong> 欧盟的消费者赋能指令（Directive (EU) 2024/825）把「环境与社会特征、包括耐久性、可维修性或可回收性等循环性方面」纳入可被禁止的误导行为的适用范围，并禁止把商品「呈现为允许维修而实际不允许」，还要求在有欧盟层面可维修性评分时向消费者提供该评分（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32024L0825\">Directive (EU) 2024/825</a>）。这对翻新业务的直接影响是：翻新商品的可维修性披露与「翻新」宣称必须准确，含糊的「环保」「绿色」宣称在欧盟范围内已被明确禁止。</p>\n<p><strong>第二是产品数字身份方向。</strong> 欧盟的生态设计可持续产品法规（ESPR）自 2024 年 7 月生效，并配套数字产品护照（DPP）的概念，DPP 的支持者描述其目标是建立跨部门的产品数据模型与开放的数据交换协议，并预期在 2027 年前后逐步落地（<a href=\"https://cirpassproject.eu/\">CIRPASS</a>）。对翻新业务而言，DPP 意味着未来一台设备的生命周期记录（维修历史、部件更换）可能成为可查询的字段——这既增加了披露负担，也提供了把「翻新质量」做成可验证卖点的机会。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>合规方向</th>\n<th>主要规则形态</th>\n<th>对翻新的具体影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>反绿色漂洗</td>\n<td>禁止无据的环境宣称</td>\n<td>「环保翻新」类文案需可验证依据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可维修性披露</td>\n<td>提供评分与配件信息</td>\n<td>上架页需含可维修性字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>产品数字护照</td>\n<td>生命周期数据可查询</td>\n<td>维修与换件记录需结构化留存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二手商品质保</td>\n<td>依当地消费者法</td>\n<td>翻新质保成本必须计入定价</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"维修记录的结构化留存\">维修记录的结构化留存</h3><p>上述合规方向的共同要求是<strong>可追溯</strong>。这给验机与翻新环节提出了一个具体的数据要求：换件、维修、检测的记录必须以结构化的形式与设备身份绑定，而不是以工单备注的形式散落在系统里。设备身份可以用序列号或其哈希；记录内容至少包括更换的部件、时间、执行方、以及翻新后的复检结果。这份记录在当下服务于质保索赔归因，在未来可能直接成为 DPP 的数据源。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE refurb_records (&#10;  record_id      BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  device_identity_hash TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  inspection_id  BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES inspection_results(inspection_id),&#10;  route          TEXT NOT NULL,        -- refurb_resell | recycle | return&#10;  swapped_parts  JSONB NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;[]&#39;,&#10;  post_refurb_grade TEXT,&#10;  warranty_months INTEGER,&#10;  operator_id    TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  completed_at   TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_refurb_device ON refurb_records (device_identity_hash, completed_at DESC);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> refurb_records</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  record_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  device_identity_hash </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  inspection_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inspection_results(inspection_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  route</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- refurb_resell | recycle | return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  swapped_parts  JSONB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '[]'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  post_refurb_grade </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  warranty_months </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  operator_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  completed_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_refurb_device</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> refurb_records (device_identity_hash, completed_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>device_identity_hash</code> 上的索引是这份记录可用的前提：质保索赔时的第一个查询就是「这台设备之前翻修过什么」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"回收路线的资质与证据链\">回收路线的资质与证据链</h2><p>走回收路线的设备，其价值实现方式是材料。这条路线的工程重点不是价格，而是<strong>证据链</strong>：平台需要能证明设备被交给了有资质的处置方，且处置过程符合当地对电子废物的要求。</p>\n<p>证据链的最小集合是：移交单据（设备清单与重量）、处置方的资质证明、以及处置结果的回收凭证。这三项在不同法域的强制程度不同，但即便当地不强制，平台自身也需要它们来支撑减碳核算的数据基础（见 <a href=\"tradein-volume-carbon-impact\">换新规模与减碳度量</a>）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;transfer_id&quot;: &quot;tr_7b02&quot;,&#10;  &quot;recycler&quot;: { &quot;name_ref&quot;: &quot;vendor_44&quot;, &quot;license_no&quot;: &quot;…&quot;, &quot;license_expiry&quot;: &quot;2027-03-31&quot; },&#10;  &quot;manifest&quot;: { &quot;device_count&quot;: 128, &quot;total_weight_kg&quot;: 24.6, &quot;hazardous_flags&quot;: [&quot;swollen_battery:3&quot;] },&#10;  &quot;evidence&quot;: { &quot;transfer_note&quot;: &quot;tn_7b02.pdf&quot;, &quot;recycle_certificate&quot;: &quot;rc_2026Q4_44.pdf&quot; },&#10;  &quot;status&quot;: &quot;closed&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"transfer_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tr_7b02\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"recycler\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"vendor_44\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"license_no\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"…\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"license_expiry\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2027-03-31\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"manifest\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"device_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"total_weight_kg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24.6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"hazardous_flags\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"swollen_battery:3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"evidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"transfer_note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tn_7b02.pdf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"recycle_certificate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rc_2026Q4_44.pdf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"closed\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两个字段的设计意图：<code>hazardous_flags</code> 单独列出膨胀电池等危险项，因为它们的处置要求与普通设备不同；<code>license_expiry</code> 必须被监控，委托给资质过期的处置方会在事后审计中暴露为合规缺陷。把资质有效期纳入系统并设置到期告警，是这类外包合规的最低要求。</p>\n<h3 id=\"危险品的单独通道\">危险品的单独通道</h3><p>膨胀电池、被液体污染、以及被判定为不可拆解的整机，不能进入普通的电子废物回收通道。它们的处置要求更接近危险废物，需要单独的持证方与单独的单据。这类设备在换新总量中占比很小，但它是合规审计中最容易被抽查的部分，因为处置不当的环境后果最严重。</p>\n<h2 id=\"路线决策的闭环\">路线决策的闭环</h2><p>把本篇的判据接回整条链路，处置路线的选择实际上应当<strong>反哺报价模型</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  Q[报价] --&gt; B[基准价 base]&#10;  B --&gt; R1[翻新后售价期望]&#10;  B --&gt; R2[回收材料价值期望]&#10;  R1 --&gt; E[期望变现价值]&#10;  R2 --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; C[成本: 部件/工时/质保/物流/处置]&#10;  C --&gt; N[净边际]&#10;  N --&gt;|负| X[收紧该型号报价或停收]&#10;  N --&gt;|正| Y[维持或提高报价竞争力]&#10;  Y --&gt; Q\">graph TD\n  Q[报价] --&gt; B[基准价 base]\n  B --&gt; R1[翻新后售价期望]\n  B --&gt; R2[回收材料价值期望]\n  R1 --&gt; E[期望变现价值]\n  R2 --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; C[成本: 部件/工时/质保/物流/处置]\n  C --&gt; N[净边际]\n  N --&gt;|负| X[收紧该型号报价或停收]\n  N --&gt;|正| Y[维持或提高报价竞争力]\n  Y --&gt; Q</pre><p>这条闭环的意义在于：报价不应当只参考二手市场价，还应当参考<strong>平台自身的变现能力</strong>。同一个型号，在有翻新产能的市场可以给出比没有产能的市场更有竞争力的报价，因为它的期望变现价值更高。反过来，当某个型号的翻新净边际持续为负，正确的动作是收紧报价甚至停止回收该型号，而不是继续按市场价收进一批无法变现的库存。</p>\n<p>这个反馈信号的落地方式是给报价模型增加一个型号级的「变现系数」，由处置路线的历史净边际估计得到，并按月更新。它属于 <a href=\"../used-tradein-valuation/condition-market-residual-value\">成色与市场残值估价模型</a> 里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>market-adjust</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{\\text{market-adjust}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">market-adjust</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 修正项的合理来源之一，但幅度应当受限——处置能力的变化通常是缓慢的，突变往往意味着数据错误而不是真实趋势。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>处置路线是设备状态、法域准入、产能与市场需求三者的交集；交集为空时只能按废物处置，这必须在报价阶段被预见到。</li>\n<li>翻新门槛不止「能开机」，还包括可更换件状态与可承诺的质保；缺件断供是翻新的隐性否决项，激活锁是硬性否决项。</li>\n<li>翻新净边际必须计入质保期望成本与处置成本，并作为型号级「变现系数」反哺报价模型。</li>\n<li>二手上架的合规负担集中在反绿色漂洗、可维修性披露、产品数字护照与质保承继；对应要求是维修记录的结构化留存。</li>\n<li>回收路线的工程重点是证据链（移交单据 + 资质 + 回收凭证）；处置方资质有效期必须纳入监控。</li>\n<li>危险品类（膨胀电池等）走单独的危险废物通道，是合规审计中最易被抽查的部分。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"翻新转售与回收处置衔接","id":"翻新转售与回收处置衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三条处置路线及其门槛","id":"核心概念-三条处置路线及其门槛"},{"level":2,"text":"平台翻新的状态门槛","id":"平台翻新的状态门槛"},{"level":3,"text":"翻新成本的计入与定价","id":"翻新成本的计入与定价"},{"level":2,"text":"二阶市场准入与合规","id":"二阶市场准入与合规"},{"level":3,"text":"维修记录的结构化留存","id":"维修记录的结构化留存"},{"level":2,"text":"回收路线的资质与证据链","id":"回收路线的资质与证据链"},{"level":3,"text":"危险品的单独通道","id":"危险品的单独通道"},{"level":2,"text":"路线决策的闭环","id":"路线决策的闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"估价差异补退结算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-in-exchange-program/tradein-collect-logistics/price-diff-settlement"},"next":{"title":"循环经济政策激励","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-in-exchange-program/circular-downstream-policy/circular-policy-incentive"}}